# Dusk

@ box day "Today" 40,40 340x400 #4285F4 ^topleft ~small
@ box ideas "Ideas shaped" 60,80 130x50 >day
@ box bugs "Bugs chased" 200,80 160x50 >day
@ box lines "Lines written" 60,150 130x50 >day
@ box erased "Lines erased" 200,150 160x50 >day
@ box tests "Tests green" 60,220 130x50 #34A853 >day
@ box talked "Conversations" 200,220 160x50 >day
@ box learned "Things learned" 100,310 200x60 ~large >day

@ arrow ideas -> lines
@ arrow lines -> erased "some"
@ arrow erased -> tests "until"
@ arrow bugs -> tests "caught by"

@ box evening "Now" 460,140 260x200 #9C27B0 ^topleft ~small
@ box breath "A slow breath" 480,185 200x50 ~large >evening
@ box quiet "Quiet screen" 480,255 200x50 >evening

@ box rest "Rest" 460,400 260x80 #F9AB00
@ note 480,460 "The work will be here tomorrow."

@ arrow day -> evening "letting go"
@ arrow evening -> rest

@ note 40,480 "Good things take time."
@ note 40,510 "Good rest makes good things."
